@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Bundled Inter fonts
+
+Unmodified static OpenType faces from Inter 4.1.
+
+Source: https://github.com/rsms/inter/releases/tag/v4.1
+Archive: https://github.com/rsms/inter/releases/download/v4.1/Inter-4.1.zip
+
+These resources are published in the optional `macos-fonts` artifact and are
+included only in macOS application runtimes. `themes/fonts_macos.css` registers
+the four faces through JavaFX and preserves the existing theme sizes and styles.
+
+Copyright and redistribution terms: see [LICENSE.txt](LICENSE.txt).
+
+SHA-256 of the unmodified files:
+
+```text
+d4f2b9e148059a15f014cb0f0b8fea8cd11bfa447dd483bedf1b0adc0e2ba799  Inter-Regular.otf
+9fc6261e817d0b1b2bf1953d8799bb1c837d11aeebbf83ae352e7b4d6de6425d  Inter-Bold.otf
+3bdf49f72ad2f2959a2619ceef700784504f6d17f502e2e2bc6edce5d43ca631  Inter-Italic.otf
+84e07cd77951a855c668f71e63af261f42d019dc80e963326b4c560b1fca8dcd  Inter-BoldItalic.otf
+```
diff --git a/mzmine-community/src/os_specific/macosFonts/resources/themes/fonts_macos.css b/mzmine-community/src/os_specific/macosFonts/resources/themes/fonts_macos.css
